# Digio - SALE request (A0), credit card.
# Tags from §5.4.1: 21 action A0, 01 amount in satang as ASCII digits, 03
#   POS user name, 04 six-digit reference, 05 payment type A1 (credit).
# Tag 05 is always sent: "if you not set default will be select payment type
#   screen", which would put the choice on the terminal instead of the till.
# Source: Digio "A920 Link-PoS-Spec" v2.21 (20 Oct 2025), section numbers as
#   printed there.
# Framing per §4: [3E 55][BER length][content][XOR CRC over header..content].
# THE CRC IS GENERATED, NEVER COPIED: seven of the ten complete frames the
#   document prints carry a CRC its own §4 rule does not produce.
# Recorded from the wire between src/terminal/digio.ts and simulator-digio.ts.

